<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ASARCO cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ASARCO cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it downgraded ASARCO Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Cited 25.6 percent rise in share price since the beginning of the year.</p>
<p>-- Also expressed concern that recent strength in copper prices is unsustainable.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/4 to 30-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
